  "source_brief": "# Instrument Pad\n\n**Site.** A 20 m by 20 m patch of firm regolith 150 m north of the landing pad. Surface fines are 15 cm deep. Depot to the south; no recharging.\n\n**Structures.**\n\n1. Instrument pad: 10 m by 10 m, stripped of fines, levelled to plus or minus 3 cm and compacted, with four staked anchor points.\n\n**Fleet.** EX1 (excavator, 5000 Wh), CP1 (compactor, 3500 Wh) and SV1 (surveyor, 1500 Wh).\n\n**Deadline.** 3 days.\n\n**Operational constraints.**\n\n- The surveyor stakes the pad before stripping and certifies the level after compaction.\n- Only one robot may work inside the pad at a time.\n"
